From 54edd5e0b7875b023b46ed99b3acc72dc099570a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 03:58:35 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(post): Haas, Mazak and Sinumerik probe goldens take
 #570's safe-plane descent

The same #579/#583 clash as #695 in the other dialects' bore-centre probe
goldens: probe_dialects failed 3/13 on main. The regenerated goldens rapid
only to the safe plane (Z50) and descend with a protected skip/MEAS move,
where the stale ones rapided to Z25. Mazak's no-contact GOTO label moves
from 9002 to 9003, one more guard ahead of it.

Refs #695

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX
